    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Charming World of Adventure and Mystery</h2><br>Embark on a perilous journey through dungeons, toxic sewers, haunted graveyards, and a ghastly cathedral. Pesky ghosts will try to ruin your day but don\u2019t be afraid... These ghosts are more charming than spooky!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be the Knightiest Knight</h2><br>Play as the determined knight and defeat foes with your trusty sword. Discover secrets and unravel the knight's story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Areas</h2><br>Your journey will take you through 12 levels with 4 themes. You will face intriguing puzzles, various enemies, and challenging bosses. <br>Master your sword and your wits to survive the night!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenging Bosses</h2><br>Face challenging, quirky bosses! Take down the 9 unique bosses and emerge from the darkness!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1087480/extras/f45b008ef4c6a41a82046f4193cd41c7.poster.avif?t=1727115339\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1087480/extras/f45b008ef4c6a41a82046f4193cd41c7.webm?t=1727115339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1087480/extras/f45b008ef4c6a41a82046f4193cd41c7.mp4?t=1727115339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple and Engaging Combat</h2><br>Wield your sword in combat and strike back ghosts that try to face you. Positioning and timing are key to survive the night!",
